{"metadata":{"role":"sampleCode","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"title":"WebAuthnInterceptorSample: FIDO2\/WebAuthn client for WKWebView","color":{"standardColorIdentifier":"yellow"},"roleHeading":"Sample Code"},"kind":"article","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthnInterceptorSampleCode"},"sampleCodeDownload":{"action":{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Yubico\/yubikit-swift\/tree\/main\/Samples\/WebAuthnInterceptorSample","overridingTitle":"View Source","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},"kind":"sampleDownload"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This sample shows how to build a FIDO2 client that intercepts WebAuthn API calls in a WKWebView and routes them to a YubiKey via NFC (iOS) or USB HID (macOS). The app demonstrates using "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for FIDO2 operations and handling the PRF extension for deriving secrets."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The WebAuthn interceptor shows how to build applications that:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Intercept "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"navigator.credentials.create()"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"navigator.credentials.get()"},{"type":"text","text":" in a WKWebView"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Convert between WebAuthn API types and CTAP2 protocol structures","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Handle PIN entry with retry logic","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Support the PRF extension (hmac-secret) for deriving cryptographic secrets","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Connect via NFC on iOS or USB HID on macOS"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This sample bypasses the WebKit WebAuthn implementation and uses the YubiKit SDK instead, giving you full control over the authentication flow, PIN UI, and access to extensions like PRF."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Architecture-Overview","text":"Architecture Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The sample consists of the following components:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Interceptor.js","type":"text"}]},{"text":": Injected into the WKWebView to intercept WebAuthn API calls","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"WebView.swift"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Sets up the WKWebView with the interceptor and message handlers"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"WebAuthnHandler.swift"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Manages YubiKey connection and PIN flow, delegates to client logic"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"WebAuthnClientLogic.swift","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Builds CTAP2 extension inputs and extracts results","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"WebAuthnTypes.swift","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Request\/response types for JSON serialization between JS and Swift","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PINEntryView.swift"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": SwiftUI PIN entry UI and async handler","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"ContentView.swift","type":"text"}]},{"text":": Main UI with URL bar and navigation controls","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The flow works as follows:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"JavaScript intercepts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"navigator.credentials.create()"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"navigator.credentials.get()"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The request is serialized and sent to Swift via "},{"code":"WKScriptMessageHandler","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift converts the request to CTAP2 format and communicates with the YubiKey"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The response is converted back to WebAuthn format and returned to JavaScript"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Intercepting-WebAuthn-Calls","text":"Intercepting WebAuthn Calls"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"JavaScript-Injection","text":"JavaScript Injection"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The interceptor replaces the browser’s WebAuthn API with custom implementations:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["const originalCreate = navigator.credentials.create.bind(navigator.credentials);","const originalGet = navigator.credentials.get.bind(navigator.credentials);","","navigator.credentials.create = function(options) {","    console.log('[WebAuthn] Intercepting create');","    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {","        pendingResolve = resolve;","        pendingReject = reject;","","        const request = {","            type: 'create',","            origin: window.location.origin,","            request: encodeRequest(options.publicKey)","        };","        \/\/ Base64 encode to safely pass through the JS\/Swift bridge","        window.webkit.messageHandlers.__webauthn_create__.postMessage(btoa(JSON.stringify(request)));","    });","};"],"syntax":"javascript"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The script is injected at document start to ensure it runs before any website code:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let script = WKUserScript(","    source: interceptorScript,","    injectionTime: .atDocumentStart,","    forMainFrameOnly: true",")","config.userContentController.addUserScript(script)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Receiving-Messages-in-Swift","text":"Receiving Messages in Swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Coordinator"},{"type":"text","text":" class implements "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WKScriptMessageHandler"},{"type":"text","text":" to receive the intercepted requests:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["func userContentController(_ userContentController: WKUserContentController, didReceive message: WKScriptMessage) {","    \/\/ Decode the base64-encoded request from JavaScript","    guard let base64 = message.body as? String,","          let data = Data(base64Encoded: base64) else { return }","","    Task {","        await handleWebAuthnMessage(name: message.name, data: data)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"CTAP2-Communication","text":"CTAP2 Communication"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Creating-Credentials","text":"Creating Credentials"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"handleCreate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method converts WebAuthn "},{"code":"PublicKeyCredentialCreationOptions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to CTAP2 "},{"code":"MakeCredential","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameters:"}]},{"code":["func handleCreate(_ data: Data) async throws -> String {","    let wrapper = try JSONDecoder().decode(CreateRequestWrapper.self, from: data)","    let request = wrapper.request","","    let session = try await makeSession()","","    let rpEntity = WebAuthn.PublicKeyCredential.RPEntity(","        id: request.rp.id,","        name: request.rp.name","    )","    let userEntity = WebAuthn.PublicKeyCredential.UserEntity(","        id: Data(base64Encoded: request.user.id) ?? Data(),","        name: request.user.name,","        displayName: request.user.displayName","    )","","    let params = CTAP2.MakeCredential.Parameters(","        clientDataHash: clientDataHash,","        rp: rpEntity,","        user: userEntity,","        pubKeyCredParams: pubKeyParams,","        excludeList: excludeList,","        extensions: extState.inputs,","        rk: true","    )","","    let response = try await session.makeCredential(parameters: params, token: pinToken).value","    \/\/ Convert response back to WebAuthn format...","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Getting-Assertions","type":"heading","text":"Getting Assertions","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Similarly, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handleGet"},{"type":"text","text":" converts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PublicKeyCredentialRequestOptions"},{"type":"text","text":" to CTAP2 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GetAssertion"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["func handleGet(_ data: Data) async throws -> String {","    let wrapper = try JSONDecoder().decode(GetRequestWrapper.self, from: data)","    let request = wrapper.request","","    let session = try await makeSession()","","    let params = CTAP2.GetAssertion.Parameters(","        rpId: request.rpId,","        clientDataHash: clientDataHash,","        allowList: allowList,","        extensions: extState.inputs","    )","","    let response = try await session.getAssertion(parameters: params, token: pinToken).value","    \/\/ Convert response back to WebAuthn format...","}"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"PIN Handling","anchor":"PIN-Handling"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The sample implements a PIN retry loop that prompts the user when verification fails. If the YubiKey has a PIN configured, it requests a PIN token using ","type":"text"},{"code":"session.getPinUVToken()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before performing CTAP2 operations. Invalid PIN attempts are caught and the user is prompted to retry.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"PRF Extension (hmac-secret)","anchor":"PRF-Extension-hmac-secret"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The PRF extension allows deriving cryptographic secrets from credentials. This is useful for encryption keys that are bound to both the credential and user-provided salts."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Requesting PRF During Credential Creation","anchor":"Requesting-PRF-During-Credential-Creation"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if let prfEval = request.extensions?.prf?.eval,","   let firstData = Data(base64Encoded: prfEval.first) {","    let prf = try await WebAuthn.Extension.PRF(session: session)","    let secondData = prfEval.second.flatMap { Data(base64Encoded: $0) }","    state.inputs.append(try prf.makeCredential.input(first: firstData, second: secondData))","    state.prf = prf","} else if request.extensions?.prf != nil {","    \/\/ Just enable PRF without evaluating","    let prf = try await WebAuthn.Extension.PRF(session: session)","    state.inputs.append(prf.makeCredential.input())","    state.prf = prf","}"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Extracting PRF Results","anchor":"Extracting-PRF-Results"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"During credential creation, you typically get confirmation that PRF is enabled:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if let prf = state.prf, let prfResult = try prf.makeCredential.output(from: response) {","    results.prf = PRFOutput(prfResult)","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"During assertion (authentication), you get the actual derived secrets:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if let prf = state.prf, let secrets = try prf.getAssertion.output(from: response) {","    results.prf = PRFOutput(secrets)","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The secrets are 32-byte HMAC-SHA256 outputs derived from the credential’s secret key and the provided salt values. These are deterministic - the same salts always produce the same outputs for a given credential."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Platform-Specific Connections","anchor":"Platform-Specific-Connections"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The sample handles iOS and macOS differently:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["private func makeSession() async throws -> CTAP2.Session {","    #if os(iOS)","    let conn = try await NFCSmartCardConnection(alertMessage: \"Tap your YubiKey\")","    #else","    let conn = try await HIDFIDOConnection()","    #endif","","    connection = conn","    let session = try await CTAP2.Session.makeSession(connection: conn)","    return session","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"On iOS, NFC provides a system dialog prompting the user to tap their YubiKey. On macOS, USB HID waits for a FIDO-capable device to be connected.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Binary Encoding","anchor":"Binary-Encoding"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The WebAuthn API uses "},{"code":"ArrayBuffer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for binary fields, but WebKit’s Swift-to-JavaScript bridge only supports JSON, which has no binary type. The sample uses standard base64 encoding in both directions for simplicity. The entire message is then wrapped in standard base64 for transport.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Requests (JS → Swift)","level":3,"anchor":"Requests-JS-%E2%86%92-Swift","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"WebAuthn request options contain "},{"code":"ArrayBuffer","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" fields like "},{"code":"challenge","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"user.id","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The "},{"code":"encodeRequest","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" function recursively converts these to base64 strings before JSON serialization:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["function encodeRequest(obj) {","    if (obj instanceof ArrayBuffer) {","        return base64Encode(obj);","    }","    \/\/ recurse into objects\/arrays...","}"],"syntax":"javascript","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Responses (Swift → JS)","level":3,"anchor":"Responses-Swift-%E2%86%92-JS","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift wraps binary data as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"{\"__binary__\": \"<base64>\"}"},{"type":"text","text":". On the JavaScript side, a recursive function finds all "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"__binary__"},{"type":"text","text":" markers and decodes them to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ArrayBuffer"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct BinaryValue: Codable {","    let __binary__: String","    init(_ data: Data) {","        self.__binary__ = data.base64EncodedString()","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This allows Swift to wrap any ","type":"text"},{"code":"Data","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in ","type":"text"},{"code":"BinaryValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" without needing to know which specific fields the WebAuthn API expects as binary.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Response Structure","level":2,"anchor":"Response-Structure","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The sample converts CTAP2 responses back to the expected WebAuthn structure:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct CredentialResponse: Codable {","    let type: String","    let id: String?","    let rawId: BinaryValue?","    let response: AuthenticatorResponse","    let clientExtensionResults: ExtensionResults?","    let authenticatorAttachment: String?","","    init(clientDataJSON: Data, makeCredentialResponse: CTAP2.MakeCredential.Response, extensionResults: ExtensionResults? = nil) {","        let credentialId = makeCredentialResponse.authenticatorData.attestedCredentialData?.credentialId","        self.type = \"public-key\"","        self.id = credentialId?.base64urlEncodedString()","        self.rawId = BinaryValue(credentialId)","        self.response = AuthenticatorResponse(clientDataJSON: clientDataJSON, makeCredentialResponse: makeCredentialResponse)","        self.clientExtensionResults = extensionResults","        self.authenticatorAttachment = \"cross-platform\"","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The response is then JSON-encoded and passed back to JavaScript via a callback:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let encodedResponse = Data(response.utf8).base64EncodedString()","_ = try? await webView?.evaluateJavaScript(\"__webauthn_callback__('\\(encodedResponse)')\")"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/webauthninterceptorsamplecode"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/OATHSampleCode","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/PIVToolSampleCode"],"title":"Sample code","generated":true,"anchor":"Sample-code"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"references":{"documentation-header.png":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation-header@2x.png","traits":["2x","light"]},{"url":"\/images\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation-header~